OL,3,GNEWSABond producer first female
OL,4,Apresident of film school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA producer whose credits include the
OL,7,FJames Bond movies has been announced as
OL,8,Fthe first female president of a film
OL,9,Fschool.
OL,11,FBarbara Broccoli will take over the
OL,12,Frole at the UK's National Film and
OL,13,FTelevision School (NFTS) in
OL,14,FBeaconsfield, Buckinghamshire, in
OL,15,FFebruary, succeeding Oscar-winning
OL,16,Fproducer David Puttnam.
OL,18,FShe has produced nine Bond films with
OL,19,Fher half-brother, Michael G. Wilson,
OL,20,Fbefore it was announced in February
OL,21,Fthat Amazon MGM Studios had gained
OL,22,Fcreative control.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
